  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.DuckDBOASIS v2.0.3\n\nDuckDB OASIS Provider - in-process analytical (OLAP) SQL database for OASIS holons and avatars via DuckDB.NET. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Add retained read-only DuckDB hosting to the accepted Waku release (ec4e68d)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- refactor: verify DuckDB native storage through shared record policy (e4db412)\n- Restore DuckDB and native MongoDB and Neo4j replica contracts (aaaf0bc)\n- Restore omitted DuckDB CQL source and published launcher from retained integration (cd261cc)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.DuckDBOASIS",
